  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、色も形も可愛くて、\r\nなんだか恋鐘にもらったチョコを思い出してさ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901029080020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふふ、そうなんやね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490102908/4901029080020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901029080030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～\r\n勇気出して、手作り渡してよかったばい……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490102908/4901029080030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901029080040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "こい、どがんして食べると？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490102908/4901029080040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのまま食べてもいいし、クッキーにトッピングしたり、\r\n紅茶やミルクに入れたりしてもいいみたいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901029080050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そうなんやね\r\nどん食べ方も美味しそうばい……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490102908/4901029080050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、見た目より日持ちするみたいだけど、\r\n早めに食べちゃってくれ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901029080060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そげん、もったいなか！\r\n棚に飾って、ゆ～っくり眺めてから、いただくけん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
